CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788929257
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham looks to show he
OL,4,Awill go further than Starmer with West
OL,5,ABank sanctions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis latest announcement is both a
OL,8,Flogical extension of that decision of
OL,9,F12 months ago, senior figures argue,
OL,10,Fbut also, in words and actions, an
OL,11,Fexpression of Burnham's desire to go
OL,12,Ffurther than his predecessor Sir Keir
OL,13,FStarmer was willing to.
OL,15,FIt is, Miliband believes, a
OL,16,Fre-assertion of the logic of eventually
OL,17,Farriving at a two-state solution ` a
OL,18,Fviable Palestinian state alongside
OL,19,FIsrael.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
